  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.2: Unique 10-digit transaction IDs (NormalizeTransactionId) for OTP, auth, and eKYC; deprecated hard-coded default. IdNet.Api: load IdNetSdk.Api/.env first; optional MISP_LICENSE_KEY alias mispLicenseKey.",
